I couldn't find the switch in this repo. A search for `PAYMENTS_LIVE` returned nothing. The only env var read anywhere is `EXPORT_BUCKET` in `scripts/export.py`, and there's no code that mentions a fake, mock or stub gateway. So the fallback must live somewhere I can't see from here, such as deploy config, a dependency or another service.

I saved a hazard note to EngramDB so it surfaces next time anyone debugs payments. I marked it as user-reported and unverified, with the caveat that it isn't in this repo.

Where is the gateway selected? If you point me at it, I can:
- make the fallback loud, with a startup warning or a visible "FAKE GATEWAY" log line;
- make it fail closed, so the app refuses to start without an explicit choice;
- update the memory with the real location.

